Right now click here to learn all about The
Avengers footage at Comic Con and click here

00:12:23.450 --> 00:12:25.560
to learn about the Batman vs Superman footage.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.660
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.
High Fives!

